OL,3,GNEWSAChild in pram injured after being
OL,4,Ahit by firework
OL,5,
OL,6,FA child was injured after being hit by
OL,7,Fa firework thrown near their pram in
OL,8,FGlasgow.
OL,10,FPolice said the firework had been
OL,11,Flaunched in the direction of a woman
OL,12,Fand her children in the Linkwood Place
OL,13,Farea of Drumchapel, at about 18:35 on
OL,14,FSaturday.
OL,16,FDet Con Ashley Convery said: "This was
OL,17,Fa completely reckless act that left the
OL,18,Fwoman and her children understandably
OL,19,Fshaken.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
